},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾐﾙｸｺｺｱ＋ﾐﾙｸって甘過ぎない?\nとか言われるのですが\nあたし実は 甘党(´･Д･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｱｲｽﾃｨｰのSには ｶﾞﾑｼﾛｯﾌﾟ5\nﾐﾙｸ4の比率ですし←ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも最近はお砂糖類は\n控えめにしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はｶﾞﾑｼﾛｯﾌﾟ2 ﾐﾙｸ3\nになりました(´･ω･`)我慢｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装のｼｬﾒ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/camera.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以外に 好評"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bar.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でびっくりしましたああ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあんまり男の子っぽく\n見えなかった方がたくさん\nいらっしゃるみたいで←。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしは男の子には\nなれないのか(;o;)まいおー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/kissmark.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし、ｸｴｽﾁｮﾝ返しします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cute.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾁｪｯｸﾁｪｯｸﾁｪｯｸ (^･ω･^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.風邪対策でよい習慣などは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.毎日やってるのはｳｶﾞｲ\n手洗いで冬限定はﾏｽｸ\nして寝ることです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sign01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喉痛くなっちゃうので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.斉藤っていう名字で損\nしたこと･得したことは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.えー損も得もあんまり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sad.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど『斉藤』って\n呼ばれるととりあえず\n振り向いちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bell.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｼｮｳｶﾞﾅｲ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.前髪何でそんな良い感じなの?\nA.あたしの前髪はちょい\n長めに切ってあって\nそれをｺﾃでくるん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/ribbon.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と\nしてるんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/snow.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.BLTなどたくさん買って\nお金を使うﾌｧﾝの方と、\n握手とかに遠征してくれる\nﾌｧﾝ方どっちのが嬉しい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んーこれはーどっちも\nあたしは思ってくれている\nという気持ち変わらないので\nとても嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので選ぶことは\n出来ません。ごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sad.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも握手とかしに来てくれた\n方がお話出来るしあたしも\n顔を覚えたいので...."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/good.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.何か資格持ってる?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あたしは高校受験"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/pencil.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の為に\n英検漢検 どっちも3級ぐらい\nしか...持ってないです((;o;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ｲｹﾒﾝ≒美女の方程式って\n成り立つと思う?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.どうですかね〜人による\nんではないですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/rouge.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしは可愛い顔に\n生まれてきたかったです\n(´ω｀)うん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.自分は数学が得意だけど\nゆったんは何が得意なの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あたしはー数学はまるっきり\nﾀﾞﾒです (´:ω;`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/danger.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意なんて得意なんて..。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/despair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー今日はせいたんが\nお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cake.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱちぱちぱち〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｽﾀｯﾌさんが超特大ｹｰｷを\nかってきてくれてﾒﾝﾊﾞｰで\nお祝いをしました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超特大ｹｰｷ ものの3分で\n食べきった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/restaurant.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふ\n大食い大会出れるん\nではないか...ww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしは莓いっぱい食べて\n莓の汁をまいやんに付けて\n怒られました(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/05/2011120515030000_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆kr"},{"type":"break"}